ients, would you?<br><br>Bartender Simulator will let you choose from an extremely wide range of glasses, alcohol, soft drinks and additives. You will learn professional bartending knowledge, learn various bartending techniques and much more.<br><br>BTW, you will be able to try your drinks ... Just remember to enjoy responsibly :)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1460790/extras/e853584112d5b1860500e197a607ac2b.poster.avif?t=1713258944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1460790/extras/e853584112d5b1860500e197a607ac2b.webm?t=1713258944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1460790/extras/e853584112d5b1860500e197a607ac2b.mp4?t=1713258944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
